{
  "tema": 5853,
  "slug": "condicional-poder",
  "titulo": "Conjugate poder in the conditional",
  "subtitulo": "Podría, podrías, podríamos: the future stem podr- with the conditional endings.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Poder has the irregular stem podr- in the conditional, with the regular endings: podría, podrías, podría, podríamos, podrían.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Poder** (_to be able to_) is irregular in the conditional (**el condicional simple**). It uses the same irregular stem as the future, **podr-**, and the regular conditional endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**podr-**",
            "**-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "poder"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "podría"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "podrías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "podría"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "podríamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "podrían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In English it's usually _could_: **podría** = _I could_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every form has a written accent on the **í** of the ending."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **poder** drops its **e** to travel light: **podr-**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Yo ==podría== ser bombero.",
              "en": "I could be a firefighter."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tú ==podrías== tener dinero debajo del colchón.",
              "en": "You could have money under the mattress."
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Usted ==podría== ser mi hijo!",
              "en": "You could be my son!"
            },
            {
              "es": "Nosotros ==podríamos== surfear en la tarde.",
              "en": "We could surf in the afternoon."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ellos ==podrían== comer con nosotros.",
              "en": "They could eat with us."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==podrían== trabajar en mi taller.",
              "en": "You could work in my shop."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
